# Puerta de la Liga (C9, contract 56), 10 x 8, interior. column = i, row = j. The Ruta 22 mat (4..5, 7) is the way in; the doorway in the back wall (7,0) leads to Ruta 23.
# A plain gatekeeper's room: the keeper behind the counter (a hint), a traveller and a poster. The badge checks themselves stand on Ruta 23 (eight guards, one per badge).
@map puerta_liga
@size 10 8
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 6 N
@spawn north 7 1 S
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  x  tile=floor_wood
  K  object=counter
  N  npc=guardia id=keeper face=SW script=keeper
  B  object=bookshelf interact=look text=pl.books
  T  object=table
  a  npc=vecino_m id=trav face=NW text=pl.trav
  P  object=sign interact=look text=pl.poster
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwywwywxww
  |B........
  |..N....T.
  |.KKK.P...
  |.........
  |.......a.
  |.........
  ....mm....
@warp x -> ruta_23 spawn=south
@warp m -> ruta_22 spawn=gate_door
@script keeper npc
    npc_face_hero keeper
    say pl.keeper
@end
